dex] < 0 ) {</pre><div style='margin-top: 4px; font-size: 9px; color: #999;'>---<br>此评论由代码审查工具自动生成</div></div>","created_at":"2026-03-10T16:56:44+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-11T16:52:10+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"68cbf90a3d3f9a2369581475","login":"xutianlong1","object_id":"68cbf90a3d3f9a2369581475","name":"xutianlong1","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/xutianlong1"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":617,"end_new_line":617,"start_old_line":617,"end_old_line":617,"position_type":"text"},"reply":[{"id":164850714,"body":"changed this line on [b4554c88](https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-nn/commits/detail/b4554c8815ba1fb864b2d8f8db2c9f125cae0bb6?ref=xtl-kernel&prId=2510) view [diff detail](https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-nn/merge_requests/2510/diffs?diffId=5546739&start_sha=43d03e9eec3ddce5204ed23274476de1c46dfd91&filePath=conv/conv3d_backprop_input_v2/op_kernel/arch35/convolution_3d_backprop/conv3d_bp_func.h#bbd302eb0714862826207869287fa93e0be8c693_617_617)","created_at":"2026-03-10T20:20:16+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-10T20:20:16+08:00","user":{"id":"68cbf90a3d3f9a2369581475","login":"xutianlong1","object_id":"68cbf90a3d3f9a2369581475","name":"xutianlong1","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/xutianlong1"}}]},{"id":164819688,"discussion_id":"d91ebd16a92ebc26b1291759e288528814423023","body":"<div style='font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.2;'><div style='font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 4px;'>变量引用错误: 在for循环条件中，使用了错误的变量名'ctx'来访问tiling结构体。根据上下文，应该使用'self->ctx.tiling_'来访问tiling指针。</div><div style='margin: 1px 0;'><strong>问题类型</strong>: 变量引用错误</div><div style='margin: 1px 0;'><strong>文件路径</strong>: <code style='font-size: 11px;'>conv/conv3d_backprop_input_v2/op_kernel/arch35/convolution_3d_backprop/conv3d_bp_func.h</code></div><div style='margin: 1px 0;'><strong>行号</strong>: 616</div><div style='margin: 3px 0 1px 0; font-size: 11px;'><strong>问题代码</strong>:</div><pre style='margin: 1px 0; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10px; background: #f5f5f5; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 2px; overflow-x: auto;'>    for (int splitIndex =0; splitIndex < self->ctx.tiling_->strideW * ctx.tiling_->strideH; splitIndex++) {</pre><div style='margin: 3px 0 1px 0; font-size: 11px;'><strong>修改建议</strong>:</div><pre style='margin: 1px 0; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10px; background: #f0f8ff; border: 1px solid #cce0ff; border-radius: 2px;'>将'ctx.tiling_->strideH'改为'self->ctx.tiling_->strideH'，以保持变量引用的一致性。修改后的代码应为：\n    for (int splitIndex =0; splitIndex < self->ctx.tiling_->strideW * self->ctx.tiling_->strideH; splitIndex++) {</pre><div style='margin-top: 4px; font-size: 9px; color: #999;'>---<br>此评论由代码审查工具自动生成</div></div>","created_at":"2026-03-10T16:56:47+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-11T16:52:19+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"68cbf90a3d3f9a2369581475","login":"xutianlong1","object_id":"68cbf90a3d3f9a2369581475","name":"xutianlong1","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/xutianlong1"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":616,"end_new_line":616,"start_old_line":616,"end_old_line":616,"position_type":"text"},"reply":[{"id":164850715,"body":"changed this line on [b4554c88](https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-nn/commits/detail/b4554c8815ba1fb864b2d8f8db2c9f125cae0bb6?ref=xtl-kernel&prId=2510) view [diff detail](https://gitcode.com/cann/ops-nn/merge_requests/2510/diffs?diffId=5546739&start_sha=43d03e9eec3ddce5204ed23274476de1c46dfd91&filePath=conv/conv3d_backprop_input_v2/op_kernel/arch35/convolution_3d_backprop/conv3d_bp_func.h#bbd302eb0714862826207869287fa93e0be8c693_616_616)","created_at":"2026-03-10T20:20:16+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-10T20:20:16+08:00","user":{"id":"68cbf90a3d3f9a2369581475","login":"xutianlong1","object_id":"68cbf90a3d3f9a2369581475","name":"xutianlong1","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/xutianlong1"}}]},{"id":164819894,"discussion_id":"4477b7670a3583744fda1adc97f9a0e694efc598","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n本次PR主要包含两项修改。第一项修复了卷积3D反向传播输入算子在kernel拆分HW模式下，当子填充（subpad）为负数时，输入梯度（A矩阵）的L1缓存释放逻辑缺陷。原逻辑仅在最后一次HW重排迭代时释放缓存，导致在需要重新加载A矩阵的负填充场景下，可能因缓存未及时释放而引发数据错误或性能问题。第二项修改优化了代码健壮性，将辅助函数`CheckN2HAttrAvailable`中的一个膨胀参数指针类型从非`const`改为`const`，以防止函数内部意外修改只读数据，并与同函数其他参数保持一致。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n针对第一项问题，在`UpdateFullLoadL1Status`函数中新增了辅助函数`CheckFreeA1ForKernelSplit`。该函数遍历所有子kernel，检查其上下左右四个方向的子填充值是否存在负数。若存在，则表明后续迭代需要重新加载A矩阵，此时即使不是最后一次HW重排迭代，也会将`isFreeA1_`标志置为`true`，从而及时触发A矩阵L1缓存的释放，确保后续数据加载的正确性。针对第二项优化，直接修改了`convolutionbackward.cpp`文件中`CheckN2HAttrAvailable`函数的签名，将其第二个参数`dilation5`的类型改为`const aclIntArray*`，明确了该参数的只读语义。","created_at":"2026-03-10T16:57:32+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-10T16:57:32+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":164850770,"discussion_id":"98cd2c1a1fd12951582f719d6db16202364dd689","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-10T20:20:32+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-10T20:20:32+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2